eport_%28FY75%29_%28IA_dynamicsofliquid00nunn%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","thumbwidth":1280,"thumbheight":1708,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Dynamics_of_liquid_propellant_gun_loading_systems_-_annual_progress_report_%28FY75%29_%28IA_dynamicsofliquid00nunn%29.pdf/page1-960px-Dynamics_of_liquid_propellant_gun_loading_systems_-_annual_progress_report_%28FY75%29_%28IA_dynamicsofliquid00nunn%29.pdf.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":1280,"height":1708},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e2/Dynamics_of_liquid_propellant_gun_loading_systems_-_annual_progress_report_%28FY75%29_%28IA_dynamicsofliquid00nunn%29.pdf?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dynamics_of_liquid_propellant_gun_loading_systems_-_annual_progress_report_(FY75)_(IA_dynamicsofliquid00nunn).pdf","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=91571891","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2020-06-25 22:38:37","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"<div class=\"fn\">\nDynamics of liquid propellant gun loading systems\u00a0: annual progress report [FY75]</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"PD US Government|Documents from the US Naval Postgraduate School Library|Scans from the Internet Archive/unverified|CC-PD-Mark|Scans from the Internet Archive|Books uploaded by F\u00e6|Books without Wikidata item|Reports from the Naval Postgraduate School","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\nNunn, Robert H.;Gibson, Ethan John.</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>Title from cover</dd>\n<dd>\"1 June 1975\"--Cover</dd>\n<dd>\"NPS-59NN75061A\"--Cover</dd>\n<dd>DTIC Descriptors: liquid propellant guns</dd>\n<dd>Author(s) subject terms: liquid propellant gun, fluid dynamics, loading, handling control</dd>\n<dd>Includes bibliographical references (p. 71-72)</dd>\n<dd>Technical report; 1975</dd>\n<dd>This report documents the progress during FY75 in the analytical and experimental investigation of the behavior of a liquid propellant during loading into the breech of a liquid propellant. A one-dimensional model was constructed for the unsteady behavior of the assumed incompressible liquid. An experimental loading system was designed and fabricated to test the model and to identify critical design constraints. The analytical model supported by the experiments, was used to conduct parametric studies and to provide guidance to designers of liquid propellant gun loading systems</dd>\n<dd>ck/ 8/10/09</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects: MATHEMATICAL STATISTICS.</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<dl><dd><a href=\"//archive.org/details/dynamicsofliquid00nunn\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"iarchive:dynamicsofliquid00nunn\"><bdi class=\"description en\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Internet Archive identifier</bdi>: dynamicsofliquid00nunn</a></dd>\n<dd><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/download/dynamicsofliquid00nunn/dynamicsofliquid00nunn.pdf\">https://archive.org/download/dynamicsofliquid00nunn/dynamicsofliquid00nunn.pdf</a></dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-pa